  "title": "Place & Movement Prepositions",
  "description": "in / on / at / under / above / across / through / into / from / towards",
  "level": "A2",
  "explain": {
    "ta": "இடத்தையும் இயக்கத்தையும் குறிப்பிட பல்வேறு prepositions பயன்படுத்தப்படுகின்றன. 'in' என்பது உள்ளே (in the room), 'on' என்பது மேலே (on the table), 'at' என்பது குறிப்பிட்ட இடத்தில் (at school), 'under' என்பது கீழே (under the table), 'above' என்பது மேலே (above the clouds), 'across' என்பது குறுக்கே (across the road), 'through' என்பது வழியாக (through the door), 'into' என்பது உள்ளே நுழைதல் (into the room), 'from' என்பது இருந்து (from Chennai), 'towards' என்பது நோக்கி (towards the school) என்று பொருள்படும்.",
    "en": "Different prepositions are used to indicate place and movement. 'in' means inside (in the room), 'on' means on top of (on the table), 'at' means at a specific location (at school), 'under' means below (under the table), 'above' means higher than (above the clouds), 'across' means from one side to another (across the road), 'through' means passing from one side to another (through the door), 'into' means entering (into the room), 'from' indicates origin (from Chennai), 'towards' means in the direction of (towards the school).",
